# Build tooling. Installed inside the block it belongs to
# (blocks/changelog/node_modules); this pattern matches at any depth.
node_modules/

# Generated block assets.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored: this plugin is deployed by copying the folder onto
# the site, so an ignored build/ would mean a fresh clone has no working block
# until someone runs `npm install && npm run build`. Uncomment only if you move
# to a release pipeline that builds before deploying.
# blocks/*/build/

# Source maps. `npm run start` emits them into build/; a production
# `npm run build` does not. They are development output, so they are not part of
# what gets committed or deployed.
blocks/*/build/*.map

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Release output from `gulp` (build/ is staged, the zip is the artefact).
/build/
*.zip
